        &lt;div class="agent-session-content"&gt;
                &lt;div class="agent-session-text"&gt;
                  &lt;p&gt;Implement the complete production-ready backend and local AI functionality for Tolerix on device with zero cloud dependencies.&lt;/p&gt;

                &lt;/div&gt;
