      &lt;/div&gt;

      &lt;div class="agent-session-message agent-session-assistant"&gt;
        &lt;div class="agent-session-role-badge agent-session-role-assistant"&gt;
          Agent
        &lt;/div&gt;
        &lt;div class="agent-session-content"&gt;
                &lt;div class="agent-session-text"&gt;
                  &lt;p&gt;Designed and implemented a 100% local-first architecture. 1) IndexedDB persistent layer via Dexie for jobs, files, audit runs, and machine profiles. 2) Local LiteRT-LM WebGPU runtime streaming and caching Gemma 2B and Gemma 4B open weights. 3) Deterministic SVG geometry engine calculating 2D affine transform stacks, closed path loops, and unit conversions.&lt;/p&gt;

                &lt;/div&gt;
              &lt;div class="agent-session-tool-call"&gt;

                  &lt;span class="agent-session-chevron"&gt;▸&lt;/span&gt;
