                    &lt;/div&gt;
                    &lt;div class="tool-section"&gt;
                      &lt;div class="tool-section-label"&gt;Output&lt;/div&gt;
                      &lt;pre class="agent-session-pre"&gt;&lt;code&gt;24 passed across database, extraction, geometry, and audit rules.&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
                    &lt;/div&gt;
                &lt;/div&gt;
              &lt;/div&gt;
        &lt;/div&gt;
      &lt;/div&gt;

      &lt;div class="agent-session-message agent-session-user"&gt;
        &lt;div class="agent-session-role-badge agent-session-role-user"&gt;
          You
        &lt;/div&gt;
        &lt;div class="agent-session-content"&gt;
                &lt;div class="agent-session-text"&gt;
                  &lt;p&gt;Audit the implementation for mathematical correctness in SVG bounds, duplicate path detection, strict SVG sanitization, model cache byte integrity, and HTML report escaping.&lt;/p&gt;

                &lt;/div&gt;
        &lt;/div&gt;
      &lt;/div&gt;

      &lt;div class="agent-session-message agent-session-assistant"&gt;
        &lt;div class="agent-session-role-badge agent-session-role-assistant"&gt;
          Agent
        &lt;/div&gt;
        &lt;div class="agent-session-content"&gt;
                &lt;div class="agent-session-text"&gt;
                  &lt;p&gt;Audited and refactored geometry and security components: 1) Analytical derivative extrema for quadratic/cubic Bézier curves and elliptical arcs. 2) 2D affine matrix multiplication order fixed for nested coordinate groups and non-zero viewBox origins. 3) Path duplicate comparison upgraded to normalized coordinate sequences with reversal invariance. 4) Strict SVG element and attribute allowlist blocking scripts, inline handlers, XXE entities, and external URLs. 5) Context-aware HTML escaping for print reports.&lt;/p&gt;

                &lt;/div&gt;
              &lt;div class="agent-session-tool-call"&gt;

