                  &lt;p&gt;Remove placeholder jobs and reports, and draft the Hacktoberfest Side Hustle challenge submission.&lt;/p&gt;

                &lt;/div&gt;
        &lt;/div&gt;
      &lt;/div&gt;

      &lt;div class="agent-session-message agent-session-assistant"&gt;
        &lt;div class="agent-session-role-badge agent-session-role-assistant"&gt;
          Agent
        &lt;/div&gt;
        &lt;div class="agent-session-content"&gt;
                &lt;div class="agent-session-text"&gt;
                  &lt;p&gt;Purged all mock seed jobs from the database and cleaned up form default states so every newly created job is real. Drafted post.md with architecture diagrams, feature matrix, side hustle business model, and Gemma partner category.&lt;/p&gt;

                &lt;/div&gt;
        &lt;/div&gt;
