&lt;td&gt;Share link / teach the path&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;"Force re-upload" myths&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Expired / deleted&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Recycle restore (&lt;a href="https://dev.to/adminpackstudio/restore-a-deleted-sharepoint-site-onedrive-or-file-in-microsoft-365-step-by-step-with-the-time-8lf"&gt;DEVTO_24&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;New tenant recording policy as undelete&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Upload failed + Download&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Download within 21 days; fix OD quota&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Waiting for auto-retry&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;External can't open recording&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Owner shares explicitly&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Opening org external sharing to Anyone for one MP4 without review (&lt;a href="https://dev.to/adminpackstudio/sharepoint-external-sharing-not-working-a-read-first-org-site-domain-and-entra-b2b-triage-iae"&gt;DEVTO_55&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;File exists; search misses it&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;a href="https://dev.to/adminpackstudio/sharepoint-search-not-working-a-read-first-visibility-permission-and-reindex-triage-4162"&gt;SharePoint Search triage&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
